---
output: svg
---
@startuml
' Not part of the bug (these already worked before the fix): plain
' "note ... of Class" notes attached to a whole class, rather than to
' one of its members, take a different code path (Entity.addNote /
' CucaNote) and were never affected by the shared-"tips"-entity issue.
' Pinned here as a regression guard so a future change to the member-tip
' code cannot accidentally break this adjacent, already-correct feature.
class C
note right of C #yellow
  yellow class note
end note
class D
note right of D #lightblue
  lightblue class note
end note
@enduml
